{"id":"52cb0bd08c272f4d","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-model8-powerset-preserving-extension.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Powerset Preserving Extension","display":"df-zfc-model8-powerset-preserving-extension — ZFC Model8 Powerset Preserving Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-powerset-preserving-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-powerset-preserving-extension","58-df-zfc-model9-powerset-preserving-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-powerset-preserving-extension — ZFC Model8 Powerset Preserving Extension","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-powerset-preserving-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-powerset-preserving-extension</span><span>58-df-zfc-model9-powerset-preserving-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-powerset-preserving-extension — ZFC Model8 Powerset Preserving Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,a\\in V\">\\(M,N,a\\in V\\)</span> (ground model, extension model, and local set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span> (transitive ZFC-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PowersetPreservingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PowersetPreservingExtension}_S\\)</span> (global powerset-preserving-extension predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9PowersetPreservingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9PowersetPreservingExtension}_S\\)</span> (local-at-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> variant defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}powerset\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PowersetPreservingExtension}_S(N,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\\land M\\subseteq N\\land\n\\forall a\\in M\\;\\forall X\\in N\\;(X\\subseteq a\\to X\\in M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}powerset\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PowersetPreservingExtension}_S(N,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\\land M\\subseteq N\\land\n\\forall a\\in M\\;\\forall X\\in N\\;(X\\subseteq a\\to X\\in M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}powerset\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}extension\\text{-}at}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9PowersetPreservingExtension}_S(N,M,a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\\land\nM\\subseteq N\\land a\\in M\\land\n\\forall X\\in N\\;(X\\subseteq a\\to X\\in M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}powerset\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}extension\\text{-}at}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9PowersetPreservingExtension}_S(N,M,a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\\land\nM\\subseteq N\\land a\\in M\\land\n\\forall X\\in N\\;(X\\subseteq a\\to X\\in M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary extension definition.</li>\n<li>Both predicates put the extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> before the ground model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>; the model9 variant adds the local parameter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S$ (transitive ZFC-model predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PowersetPreservingExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9PowersetPr